te with changes to the svg module\n\nI can look into fixing the specifics but we should probably evaluate if we want to maintain this functionality as buildable, drop it entirely, or just leave it\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTry to build the extension version of either text server module\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100566/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}